{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_08_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2c8159c618c95287c1f606cac37d6eb4017fc316dd0fb459ae2076d857f4adb0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e363cbc725b23eea61bd4fbb6ac3d04aa23f2c5210e4531589fa2c2dc90c676",
      "text": "各位辛苦了。收到了新的工作邀约，\n我们来确认一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a8bd2c79ba0911d995e5a6c3a95cc556566ea69008a8728d70dec3e45085a83",
      "text": "哎呀，来了不少嘛。……不过，\n不是找彩全员，而是找个人的委托比较多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74962f9fd159fa798a940a938900d36c1a677331567a25ad6938390e1aa3ceac",
      "text": "彩的各位原本就是名人，\n针对个人的邀约确实很多……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae6aebf3f1b615cd7a3159de97f4f128b24cbca67d7653b873f052fcf785bb7a",
      "text": "抱歉，是我能力不足，\n没能多为大家争取到以组合形式接下的工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ae95f3ba55abb64145fd185da61b595ed9ac22e4bf8ba1c67b1a8cd9bb81b4c",
      "text": "这不是●●●●プロデューサー酱的错啦。\n能接到工作就已经很值得感激了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f060f02f8b132bd1bcc9b858275644c709b597613492251e44bd1bc3e4867644",
      "text": "虽说如此，吾辈还是想多跟蝴蝶和\n九郎君一起工作喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75993470516a3c31f62ae52de9b66202252df81e8ce0f07cc5e106e4e7286d0b",
      "text": "确实呢……\n其他人的情况又是如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b92f9e1b0b14de20acb7311a89a0ca1460cb7cb66848ddcd0b997f4244f2cdc",
      "text": "前些天F-LAGS的各位，\n确定要出演音乐节目了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2570cb40cc91abc179e76239839f063ca5f46a3bbff32a2980f0967d9a76d461",
      "text": "哎呀，真是可喜可贺！共同切磋琢磨的伙伴能\n接下大工作，真让人高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87fb1ab19602f587f8e03031209dccde7ec9aaeba356fe06b954f4daee8848f8",
      "text": "但是，吾辈等人也不能认输喵！\n为了能以彩的身份多上电视，吾辈等人也要加油喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4dc9a3f0c019e26fe290c53a9d3ea056dc8de6724ee689cdf5ff80580684037",
      "text": "猫柳说得对。\n现在的我们没有时间去烦恼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec09a8e1be77257567d1de39635092d08d3bcc9e4f6bcd862319343c9e0a232",
      "text": "与伙伴一起，为了实现梦想。\n我们唯有奋勇向前。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000149:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几个小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000159:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d027f183ded82133ddd27110fac9693ff23892879a177233cd5f578b3a17da7",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●师父，辛苦了。\n现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000161:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01c973f3eee5bffa5a611fb59ccf6b6ff640ac8820d7e1b8c7993c47be324e56",
      "text": "其实今天有自称是THE 虎牙道粉丝的\n客人，来到我的店里了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000163:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a30f14a5d8129792fb53191e9f716e486ffea333a0895c981a36d46ac49da3dc",
      "text": "自从开始做偶像之后，\n这类的客人增加了不少呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000165:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1cdc97e57d87d7bfb45fe6de8619989582cfbf0587d9b93b0338ef131c361b2",
      "text": "听到粉丝聊起自己的事，\n虽然还不太习惯、怪不好意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000167:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e600fd5c99220f3d20ab6c397012bc7ad0dac38e02e3159ed175949b238ced0e",
      "text": "但我也觉得非常高兴！\n深深体会到出道真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000169:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2edd84e2fddc67869b2f815447c1afacaacd3ca071728383b846631bcabb993e",
      "text": "啊，还有。听店老板说，哪怕我不在店里的时候，\n也会有粉丝专程过来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000171:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f12c8bf57b8bf319046000bc7f4e64edb3b3f458823f58ce02231d3eafb53c14",
      "text": "所以为了在这种时候也能让粉丝开心，\n我正在构思限时供应的新菜单呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000173:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de5c31f063a64f97178d46dbe06654344b1fda8aa4c4f1789910b434443a44b1",
      "text": "我也想尝尝看",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000175:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e8e44859b934f375762a79b9b6b2335af2c1cb362e5c68a28503c266add9808",
      "text": "务必来！等F-LAGS的音乐节目收录\n结束后，大家一起来我的店里吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_08:1_4_001_08_d:cmd-000177:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf5d571548f647f6498a83b41933d3ea33b1c775adae0f6ac13065042a63ecfc",
      "text": "我会请大家吃最棒的\n庆功拉面的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
